  "term": "physical activity",
  "definition": "In this context, physical activity means structured exercise or movement-based activity used as a non-drug intervention to help improve executive function in children with ADHD. It can take different forms, such as aerobic, ball-sport, open, closed, leisure-fitness, or multi-component activities.",
